  "body": "The definition of [valid custom element name](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#valid-custom-element-name) includes [#xF8-#x2FF] | [#x300-#x37D]. Why is the range broken up in this way? There's no character between 0x2ff and 0x300.\n",
